{"id":"seguramente","lemma":"seguramente","pos":"adv","rank":1018,"glosses":["surely; certainly"],"ipa":"/seˌɡuɾaˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-seguramente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Seguramente estudias con ganas.","en":"You must study hard.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454735"},{"text":"Seguramente me gustará este libro.","en":"Perhaps I'll like this book.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/707157"},{"text":"Seguramente necesitarás hacer eso ahora.","en":"You most certainly will need to do that now."},{"text":"Tomás seguramente tiene unos treinta años.","en":"Tom is probably over thirty."},{"text":"Tarde o temprano, seguramente tendrás éxito.","en":"You are sure to succeed in time."}]}